{"id":238257,"vol":{"id":36091,"name":"Untold Tales of Blackest Night"},"num":"1","name":"Sea of Fear; The Evolution of Species; A Losing Battle; Blackest Nightmare; An Incident On Korugar","title":"Untold Tales of Blackest Night #1","year":"2010","date":"2010-12-01","store":"2010-10-13","poster":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_medium/6/66303/1453291-scanned_image_6.jpg","big":"https://comicvine.gamespot.com/a/uploads/scale_large/6/66303/1453291-scanned_image_6.jpg","pub":"DC Comics","deck":"","desc":"The Book of the Black is pried open once more to reveal the untold horrors that occurred during BLACKEST NIGHT as guided by Sinestro Corps member Lyssa Drak. Be witness as swarms of Black Rings scavenge for souls within the tatters of Ragman! Cringe as Scarecrow bathes in the fear he constructs as a newly minted Sinestro Corpsman! Scream as Donna Troy transforms into a Black Lantern! Squirm as Animal Man literally feels his world \u2013 and himself \u2013 die! It's the emotional spectrum at its darkest in one special standalone issue!","people":[{"id":42763,"name":"Adam Schlagman","role":"writer"},{"id":9587,"name":"Alex Sinclair","role":"colorist"},{"id":46074,"name":"Andrew Dalhouse","role":"colorist"},{"id":24919,"name":"Brett Booth","role":"artist"},{"id":19223,"name":"Brian Buccellato","role":"colorist"},{"id":2401,"name":"Ed Benes","role":"artist"},{"id":41680,"name":"Eddie Berganza","role":"editor"},{"id":9317,"name":"Ethan Van Sciver","role":"cover"},{"id":40439,"name":"Geoff Johns","role":"writer"},{"id":40487,"name":"Ivan Reis","role":"penciler"},{"id":44461,"name":"J.T. Krul","role":"writer"},{"id":61184,"name":"Jason Fabok","role":"penciler"},{"id":7681,"name":"Jeremy Love","role":"writer"},{"id":42063,"name":"John J. Hill","role":"letterer"},{"id":19385,"name":"Matt Banning","role":"cover"},{"id":51682,"name":"Nei Ruffino","role":"cover"},{"id":12505,"name":"Nick J. Napolitano","role":"letterer"},{"id":40488,"name":"Oclair Albert","role":"i